     "note": "World's largest privately held company and a top global grain/oilseed trader; major corn origination and export elevation in the US Gulf, Brazil and the Black Sea.",
     "improve": "As a private company under no SEC-filing pressure, Cargill discloses little segment-level corn volume or origin data. It should publish corn-specific origination by country and freight-route, plus traceability for Cerrado-origin feed grain, so customers and regulators can size land-use and concentration risk."
