     "note": "The 'D' of ABCD. Large Brazil/Argentina soybean origination, crushing and export terminals; privately held with limited per-commodity disclosure.",
     "improve": "LDC should disclose soy-origination volumes by Brazilian biome and the audited share of its supply under deforestation-free monitoring, plus EUDR-compliance timelines, to match the transparency demanded of listed peers."
