    "note": "Production = total world fisheries + aquaculture output (~190 Mt live weight in 2024, aquaculture now >50%), FAO FishStat/SOFIA basis; consumption = food fish supply (non-food/reduction uses excluded). Exports here = world frozen-fish HS 0303 trade only (~14-15 Mt; total seafood trade across all HS lines is far larger at ~60+ Mt / ~US$190bn). FAO-based estimates, rounded; 2024 provisional."
   },
